  "high_risk_mathematics_confirmations": [
    "892(f), 898(c/e), 903(f), and 904 are no-real-root cases, not invitations to invent real roots.",
    "893 and 899 retain the explicit solve-and-check instructions; both sum/product checks or root reconstructions are present in the frozen solutions.",
